ount + 1;\n                answer = (answer * modPow(base, count, MOD)) % MOD;\n            }\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(answer);\n    }\n\n    static long modPow(long base, long exp, long mod) {\n        long result = 1;\n        base = base % mod;\n        while (exp > 0) {\n            if ((exp & 1) == 1) {\n                result = (result * base) % mod;\n            }\n            base = (base * base) % mod;\n            exp >>= 1;\n        }\n        return result;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-6.758938252460212e-05, -8.344646857949556e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.00016497205069754273, -3.6477376852417365e-05, -0.07003960013389587, -0.3063906133174896, -8.106198947643861e-06, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -0.0001147919538198039, -0.10020928084850311, -0.0021858150139451027, -0.26440364122390747, -0.00011455356434453279, -0.020580556243658066, -3.814689989667386e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -3.3378546504536644e-06, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -0.5706292390823364, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.018178759142756462, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -0.009756735526025295, -0.0036013764329254627, -3.099436753473128e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.4676019165781327e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -6.198863957251888e-06, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -5.972207145532593e-05, -0.3875283896923065, -8.106198947643861e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -8.34461570775602e-06, -4.410734163684538e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.099436753473128e-06, -0.0019349202048033476, -0.008591593243181705, -0.00033563701435923576, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.002806655131280422, 0.0, -2.729855441430118e-05, -0.026305092498660088, -0.2014956921339035, -1.5497195136049413e-06, 0.0, -0.12446752190589905, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.446407547220588e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -3.576278118089249e